1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:08,516
The trial run began on the anniversary of the last flood, either in the valley or on the mountain top, depending on whom you asked.

2
00:00:08,516 --> 00:00:15,154
“The story has to reflect the geology, not the gloom,” the director said.

3
00:00:15,154 --> 00:00:27,280
A couple of gauges, a full breakfast, and a shiny mirror on the wall of the field center: the deal was to measure for a summer and then cut the model.

4
00:00:27,280 --> 00:00:31,913
The pattern was different from what the spatial model predicted.

5
00:00:31,913 --> 00:00:41,094
Roughly a third of the readings exceed the limit, and the soil in the hollow near the refinery holds water the way a solvent holds dye.

6
00:00:41,094 --> 00:00:46,478
“Add the groundwater and reduce the surface flow,” Maya said.

7
00:00:46,478 --> 00:00:50,606
“More of the same will give us nothing.”

8
00:00:50,606 --> 00:01:03,741
The next step outdoors was a roast and a brunch in the same afternoon: a banquet for the volunteers, with stuffing, a meaty soup, and an air conditioner running in the shed.

9
00:01:03,741 --> 00:01:11,474
“For the sake of the data,” Lin said, “keep the equipment cool and the people warm.”

10
00:01:11,474 --> 00:01:24,569
The icy vapor from the cooler, a stain on the concrete, and a slap of glue on the pipe: the volunteers worked without a sword or a couch, and the liquor stayed in the cupboard.

11
00:01:24,569 --> 00:01:31,542
“Justice is a smooth process, not an event,” the boatman said.

12
00:01:31,542 --> 00:01:36,735
A bone of the old design was that it had no mirror for its own error.

13
00:01:36,735 --> 00:01:43,073
“The global picture and the local picture have to sit at the same table,” she said.

14
00:01:43,073 --> 00:01:54,464
“A paint mark on a pole is not a measurement.” The airport on the ridge and the sky above it were the only parts of the district the model could see.

15
00:01:54,464 --> 00:02:04,345
Less, in the end, was the whole story: less sediment, less loss, and a plan that was practicable in a wet summer.

16
00:02:04,345 --> 00:02:13,637
Air conditioning in the field station and a gut feeling about the river were not the same evidence, but the team had to write both down.

17
00:02:13,637 --> 00:02:17,221
The term would end on the next anniversary.

18
00:02:17,221 --> 00:02:24,984
The air conditioning in the shed and the air conditioner on the wall were both part of the trial.
